  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. <br>• Roughly chop capsicum into bite-sized chunks. <br>• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Grate zucchini. <br>• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water. <br>• Add fusilli and a pinch of salt. Cook over high heat until ‘al dente’, 11 mins. <br>• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f70087c310625e17190e5a/step-05cf3100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. <br>• Cook carrot and capsicum until tender, 4-5 mins. <br>• Add zucchini and cook until tender, 2-3 mins. <br>• Reduce heat to medium, add Nan’s special seasoning and garlic &amp; herb spice blend, then cook until fragrant, 1 min. <br>• Stir in cooking cream, reserved pasta water and the butter and cook, until <br>bubbling, 2-3 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f70087c310625e17190e5a/step-3a986c10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat grill to high. <br>• Remove pan from heat and stir through cooked fusilli, until combined. Season with pepper. <br>• Transfer pasta mixture to a baking dish. <br>• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Grill until golden, 8-10 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f70087c310625e17190e5a/step-4cadf020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide cheesy veggie pasta bake between bowls. <br>• Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f70087c310625e17190e5a/step-86c7be30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
